.TH ferry-identity-show 1  Ferry "Ferry Manual"
.SH NAME
ferry\-identity\-show \- Show the Node ID and where the key is stored
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBferry identity show\fR [\fB\-\-lang\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
Show the Node ID and where the key is stored
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-lang\fR \fI<CODE>\fR
Interface language for this run (`en`, `pl`); overrides the saved setting
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
